           0\n          </span>\n<span>\n           g\n          </span>\n<span>\n           ）\n          </span>\n<span>\n           ，\n          </span>\n<span>\n           水\n          </span>\n<span>\n           温\n          </span>\n<span>\n           9\n          </span>\n<span>\n           2\n          </span>\n<span>\n           -\n          </span>\n<span>\n           9\n          </span>\n<span>\n           3\n          </span>\n<span>\n           ，\n          </span>\n<span>\n           3\n          </span>\n<span>\n           次\n          </span>\n<span>\n           注\n          </span>\n<span>\n           水\n          </span>\n<span>\n           （\n          </span>\n<span>\n           4\n          </span>\n<span>\n           0\n          </span>\n<span>\n           /\n          </span>\n<span>\n           1\n          </span>\n<span>\n           3\n          </span>\n<span>\n           0\n          </span>\n<span>\n           /\n          </span>\n<span>\n           1\n          </span>\n<span>\n           0\n          </span>\n<span>\n           0\n          </span>\n<span>\n           ）\n          </span>\n<span>\n           ，\n          </span>\n<span>\n           总\n          </span>\n<span>\n           冲\n          </span>\n<span>\n           煮\n          </span>\n<span>\n           时\n          </span>\n<span>\n           间\n          </span>\n<span>\n           2\n          </span>\n<span>\n           分\n          </span>\n<span>\n           -\n          </span>\n<span>\n           2\n          </span>\n<span>\n           分\n          </span>\n<span>\n           半\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          【获奖记录】\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          2018年洪都拉斯卓越杯，第二名\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          2019年洪都拉斯卓越杯，第六名\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SAsiaaB3890LUKTq8Jr7yGH0MSp7mQ4W1GcxWOVuOiakcO3ibb0vMaIgVQcjuvvnSMreDrstvP5kj6w/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于松树庄园 Los Pinos\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          松树庄园位于洪都拉斯伦皮拉地区一个名为圣安德烈斯的美丽村庄，海拔位于1650米处，具有极佳的咖啡种植气候，为种植优良高品质咖啡提供了先决条件。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Orlando在很小的时候就梦想成为一名咖农，当他和他的妻子结婚后，曾促膝长谈规划他们的未来，当时他们并没有足够的经济能力去经营任何一宗生意，但他们当时心里的想法就是要种很多很多咖啡。所以Orlando很年轻的时候便出国做了劳工，为了挣到更多启动资金来实现夫妻俩的梦想。他去美国勤奋工作了两年，攒到一笔钱后回到洪都拉斯，终于夫妻俩的咖啡事业可以启动了。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SAsiaaB3890LUKTq8Jr7yGHticKqEDPfJhNRtnicTk67g5gKaSvicMpKQ0YzsCQiae4WbiczJibEpfxwHvg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Orlando\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          种植咖啡比常人想象中要耗费更多的努力、投资和时间，为了得到期待的结果，\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          他\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          看到不同品种和品质带来的不同经济收益，想法开始改变。\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          他认识了罗尼先生，帮他把咖啡杯测分级并推广给北美及亚洲市场。\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          终于，在2018年卓越杯中，他们拿到了第二名的成绩。\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          咖啡鲜果采摘时被严格分类，在当天被脱\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          皮或洗净后日晒。\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          松树庄园会将苗圃的培育土消毒，并在咖啡树周围种上青柠以平衡土壤中的酸，适时使用杀虫剂和有机肥，调整遮阴树的状态，每日都进行脱皮这样不会有搁置提前发酵的鲜果。\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='caret-color: rgb(53, 53, 53);color: rgb(53, 53, 53);font-size: 14px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span>\n           更\n          </span>\n<span>\n           多\n          </span>\n<span>\n           咖\n          </span>\n<span>\n           啡\n          </span>\n<span>\n           ，\n          </span>\n<span>\n           请\n          </span>\n<span>\n           进\n          </span>\n<span>\n           入\n          </span>\n<span>\n           小\n          </span>\n<span>\n           程\n          </span>\n<span>\n           序\n          </span>\n<span>\n           选\n          </span>\n<span>\n           购\n          </span>\n<span>\n           哦\n          </span>\n<span>\n           ～\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style='caret-color: rgb(53, 53, 53);color: rgb(53, 53, 53);font-size: 14px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica N